          "summary": "Narrow TrueLink's Credit Data licence to service delivery and add a Client ownership/assignment clause with a licence back to embedded TrueLink IP.",
          "comment": "[Playbook] We cannot grant TrueLink rights to distribute, license, resell or otherwise exploit our borrower Credit Data, so we have limited that licence to processing the data solely to provide the Hosting and Support Services to us. We have also added the standard ownership clause: we own work product created for us (TrueLink assigning it), TrueLink keeps its Interface with a perpetual, irrevocable, royalty-free licence to any of its IP embedded in that work product, we retain all rights in our content and data, and nothing is jointly owned.",
