              "paragraphId": "p0054",
              "oldText": "Client hereby grants to TrueLink the nonexclusive worldwide right and license to use, distribute, disseminate, license, resell, exploit, upload, display, copy and store Credit Data subject to the limitations set forth in and in accordance with the Non-Competition Agreement.",
              "newText": "Client hereby grants to TrueLink the nonexclusive worldwide right and license to process, upload, display, copy and store Credit Data solely to provide the Hosting and Support Services to Client, subject to the limitations set forth in and in accordance with the Non-Competition Agreement."
            },
            {
              "kind": "insert_after",
              "paragraphId": "p0029",
              "numbering": "e.",
              "text": "Client Ownership. Client owns all deliverables and work product created for Client under this Agreement, including all results of the Support Services, and TrueLink hereby assigns such deliverables and work product to Client. TrueLink grants Client a perpetual, irrevocable, royalty-free license to any TrueLink Intellectual Property embedded in such deliverables and work product. Client retains all right, title and interest in Client Content, Client's Intellectual Property and Credit Data. No intellectual property will be jointly owned by the parties."
            }
          ]
        },
